+## 2026-11-03
+- **Files saved with old Mac line endings are refused with a clear message** ([#61](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/61)). Some older spreadsheet exports end each line with a carriage return only. The importer used to read such a file as one long row and then complain about missing columns, which was confusing. It now says which line has the problem and how to re-save the file ("CSV UTF-8"). Nothing in a file is changed or guessed; the file is simply not read until it is saved in the standard format.
+
 ## 2026-11-01
 - **CHANGELOG started.** From today every merged pull request adds an entry here.
